So, on behalf of the Franke
program and our audience today,

01:25:11.630 --> 01:25:14.910
I'd like to give you a big warm thank you.

01:25:14.910 --> 01:25:15.923
- Thanks so much for having me.

01:25:15.923 --> 01:25:17.133
It's been a lot of fun.

